  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "Chapter Saf-C 2900 had previously contained rules on the regional fuel tax agreement, which had expired 7-23-04. The prior filings affecting the former Saf-C 2900 included the following documents:\n\n#4936, effective 9-24-90\n\n#6295, effective 7-23-96, EXPIRED 7-23-04",
